  "overview": "GitLab Pajamas — design guidelines and UI components behind GitLab.",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#fff) canvas paired with `#fff` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#fc6d26` with `#0b0b0c` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `GitLab Sans` across 45 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`.25rem`), cards (`6px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
}
